          "note": "Verified: Prerequisite requirements confirmed against the official Columbia University SEAS Combined Plan curriculum guide (https://undergrad.admissions.columbia.edu/apply/combinedplan).\n\n[Academic & English Requirements]:\n- Minimum GPA: 3.3 (Competitive GPA: 3.5+)\n- TOEFL iBT: Min 100\n- IELTS: Min 7.5\n- Duolingo DET: NOT accepted",
