          "englishExemption": "① Secondary school 4년 전 과정을 영어 primary language of instruction으로 이수\n② 미국 인가 대학에서 대학 수준 English Composition 과목 성공적 이수\n⚠️ 미국 해외 분교(U.S. branch campuses abroad) 불인정\n면제 신청: Student Center → Admissions → ELP Waiver Request (처리 14 영업일)",
          "note": "Verified: Prerequisite requirements confirmed against the official University of Wisconsin-Madison College of Engineering transfer guidelines (https://engineering.wisc.edu/admissions/undergraduate/transfer-from-off-campus/).\n\n[Academic Requirements]:\n- Minimum GPA: 3.0 cumulative & term GPA (most successful: 3.2-4.0)\n- Minimum Credits: 24 transferable credits\n- TOEFL iBT: Min 80\n- IELTS: Min 6.5\n- Duolingo DET: Min 115",
