          "rawRequired": "Calculus 1 (MATH 231 at UNC) | Gen Chemistry 1 + Lab (CHEM 101/L at UNC) | Physics 1: Calculus-based Mechanics (PHYS 118 at UNC) | English Composition (ENGL 105 at UNC) | Min grade C or better in all four prerequisites | Program launched Fall 2024 (class of 2028+) -- RESTRICTED capacity | Transfer applicants apply through Common App AND submit 300-word essay to APS dept | UNC does NOT have a traditional engineering school -- APS is the ONLY engineering-adjacent BS | Available tracks: Materials Engineering, Environmental Engineering [Source: aps.unc.edu/undergraduate-major/admission/, verified May 2026]",
