          "note": "✅ Auto-Verified by AI Reviewer on 2026-06-17\n[Verified Departmental Reqs] ✅ Verified: holistic requirements review\nOfficial requirements from admissions website: https://engineering.buffalo.edu/home/academics/undergrad/admissions/transfer.html. Standard admission requires completion of the four core courses with a combined GPA of at least 2.5, or fast-track with at least two core courses and a combined GPA of at least 3.0.",
